    "created_at": "2016-06-07T21:17:33Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-06-07T21:17:33Z",
    "body": "It's not required! As I said,\n\n> In the meantime, regardless of whether we merge it or not, this can serve as a patch for the intervention discussion at WICG/interventions#17 to reference.\n\nI can't really tell if you're objecting to this spec change, or just pessimistic about it's possibility of success. If you're objecting to it, we can certainly tag this \"do not merge\" and (absent intent-to-ship from 2+ vendors) just leave it here for reference. But if you're just unsure whether it will be web-compatible, I don't quite understand your desired outcome.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
