    "created_at": "2017-07-14T08:04:58Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-07-14T08:04:58Z",
    "body": "FWIW, I'm not a big fan of lowering the bar for interventions. It's largely a Google-driven initiative and comes at the cost of predictability of platform APIs. And it's not always clear those platform APIs — though crappy — have alternatives available that meet the same engineering tradeoffs.\r\n\r\nIf anything non-determinism needs to meet a higher bar.",
